/// # Tags
///
/// AGA_Activate (BOOL) - AmigaGuide activates the window when
///     it receives a LINK command.  This tag allows the
///     application developer to turn that feature off and on.
///
/// # Returns
///
/// The installed AmigaGuide 45.7 returns a nonzero value when the supplied
/// attribute is applied. The pinned NDK leaves this `LONG` result undocumented;
/// callers should treat zero as failure rather than depending on an exact count.
///
/// # See Also
///
/// GetAmigaGuideAttr()
@library("amigaguide.library")
extern pub fn SetAmigaGuideAttrsA(cl: *u8, attrs: *TagItem) -> i32
/// Set an AmigaGuide attribute.      (V34)
